<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="de">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8" />
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
<title>Restaurant Am Fels – Menüauswahl für Reisegruppen</title>
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com" />
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin />
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Playfair+Display:ital,wght@0,400;0,500;0,600;0,700;1,400;1,500&family=Lato:wght@300;400;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet" />
<style>
  :root{
    --gold:#b8924a;
    --gold-light:#dfc089;
    --gold-dark:#9a7a48;
    --ivory:#fdfaf5;
    --cream:#f5efe4;
    --brown:#3a2516;
    --text:#6b5645;
    --line:#e2d7c3;
  }
  *{margin:0;padding:0;box-sizing:border-box;}
  body{
    font-family:'Lato',sans-serif;color:var(--brown);background:#d8ccb8;
    line-height:1.5;-webkit-print-color-adjust:exact;print-color-adjust:exact;
  }
  .page{
    width:210mm;min-height:297mm;margin:12mm auto;padding:18mm 18mm 16mm;
    background:var(--ivory);position:relative;box-shadow:0 6px 30px rgba(0,0,0,.25);overflow:hidden;
  }
  .page::before{content:"";position:absolute;inset:8mm;border:1px solid var(--line);pointer-events:none;}
  .inner{position:relative;z-index:1;}

  /* ── HEADER ── */
  .head{text-align:center;margin-bottom:9mm;}
  .brand-mark{
    width:64px;height:64px;margin:0 auto 10px;
    -webkit-mask:url(images/logo.png) center/contain no-repeat;
    mask:url(images/logo.png) center/contain no-repeat;
    background:var(--gold-dark);-webkit-print-color-adjust:exact;print-color-adjust:exact;
  }
  .est{font-size:9.5px;letter-spacing:.4em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--gold-dark);margin-bottom:12px;}
  .head h1{
    font-family:'Playfair Display',serif;font-weight:500;font-size:40px;line-height:1.05;color:var(--brown);
  }
  .head h1 em{font-style:italic;color:var(--gold);}
  .head .sub{
    font-family:'Playfair Display',serif;font-style:italic;font-size:16px;color:var(--text);margin-top:6px;
  }
  .flourish{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:12px;margin:14px 0 4px;}
  .flourish .l{width:56px;height:1px;background:var(--gold);}
  .flourish .d{width:7px;height:7px;background:var(--gold);transform:rotate(45deg);}

  /* ── DISH LIST ── */
  .list{margin-top:4mm;}
  .dish{
    display:flex;align-items:center;gap:16px;
    padding:5.2mm 0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);break-inside:avoid;
  }
  .dish:last-child{border-bottom:none;}
  .medallion{
    flex:none;width:24mm;height:24mm;border-radius:50%;
    background-size:cover;background-position:center;
    border:1px solid var(--gold);
    box-shadow:0 0 0 3px var(--ivory),0 0 0 4px var(--line),0 6px 16px rgba(58,37,22,.16);
    -webkit-print-color-adjust:exact;print-color-adjust:exact;
  }
  .dish-body{flex:1;min-width:0;}
  .dish-name{
    font-family:'Playfair Display',serif;font-weight:600;font-size:18px;color:var(--brown);
  }
  .dish-desc{font-size:11.5px;color:var(--text);line-height:1.55;margin-top:3px;padding-right:6%;}
  .dish-price{
    flex:none;font-family:'Playfair Display',serif;font-weight:600;font-size:18px;color:var(--gold-dark);
    white-space:nowrap;text-align:right;
  }
  .sizes{margin-top:5px;display:flex;gap:16px;flex-wrap:wrap;}
  .size{display:flex;align-items:baseline;gap:5px;font-size:11px;}
  .size b{font-family:'Playfair Display',serif;color:var(--brown);font-weight:600;}
  .size span{color:var(--gold-dark);font-weight:700;}

  /* ── FOOTER ── */
  .foot{margin-top:9mm;text-align:center;}
  .foot .note{
    font-style:italic;font-size:11px;color:var(--text);line-height:1.7;max-width:80%;margin:0 auto;
  }
  .foot .contact{
    margin-top:7mm;padding-top:6mm;border-top:1px solid var(--line);
    font-size:10.5px;letter-spacing:.05em;color:var(--text);line-height:1.9;
  }
  .foot .contact strong{color:var(--brown);}

  @media print{
    body{background:#fff;}
    .page{margin:0;box-shadow:none;width:auto;min-height:auto;}
  }
  @page{size:A4;margin:0;}
</style>
</head>
<body>

<div class="page">
  <div class="inner">

    <div class="head">
      <div class="brand-mark"></div>
      <div class="est">Engelskirchen · Loope</div>
      <h1>Menüauswahl für <em>Reisegruppen</em></h1>
      <div class="sub">Eine Auswahl unserer Küche – speziell für Ihre Gruppe</div>
      <div class="flourish"><span class="l"></span><span class="d"></span><span class="l"></span></div>
    </div>

    <div class="list">

      <div class="dish">
        <div class="dish-body">
          <div class="dish-name">Salat „Filetto di Manzo“</div>
          <div class="dish-desc">bunt gemischter Salat mit hausgemachtem Vinaigrette-Dressing, dazu Steakfleischstreifen, mediterranes Gemüse und Parmesan</div>
        </div>
        <div class="dish-price">18,90 €</div>
      </div>

      <div class="dish">
        <div class="dish-body">
          <div class="dish-name">Herren Teller</div>
          <div class="dish-desc">2 Schweinefiletmedaillons mit Pfeffersauce, dazu Bratkartoffeln</div>
        </div>
        <div class="dish-price">17,90 €</div>
      </div>

      <div class="dish">
        <div class="dish-body">
          <div class="dish-name">Schnitzel „Champignon“</div>
          <div class="dish-desc">paniert, mit Champignon-Rahmsauce, dazu Pommes Frites</div>
        </div>
        <div class="dish-price">19,90 €</div>
      </div>

      <div class="dish">
        <div class="dish-body">
          <div class="dish-name">Hacksteak Hirten Art</div>
          <div class="dish-desc">gefüllt mit Schafskäse, dazu Pommes Frites und Djuwetschreis</div>
        </div>
        <div class="dish-price">19,90 €</div>
      </div>

      <div class="dish">
        <div class="dish-body">
          <div class="dish-name">Zwiebelrostbraten</div>
          <div class="dish-desc">Rumpsteak mit frischen gerösteten Zwiebeln, dazu Bratkartoffeln</div>
          <div class="sizes">
            <span class="size"><b>200g</b><span>28,90 €</span></span>
            <span class="size"><b>300g</b><span>36,90 €</span></span>
            <span class="size"><b>400g</b><span>42,90 €</span></span>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="dish-price">ab 28,90 €</div>
      </div>

      <div class="dish">
        <div class="dish-body">
          <div class="dish-name">Lamm-Mix Teller</div>
          <div class="dish-desc">Lammsteak und -kotelett mit frischem Knoblauch, dazu Prinzessbohnen und Bratkartoffeln</div>
        </div>
        <div class="dish-price">28,90 €</div>
      </div>

      <div class="dish">
        <div class="dish-body">
          <div class="dish-name">Lachsfilet</div>
          <div class="dish-desc">mit Kräuterbutter, dazu Folienkartoffel mit Sauerrahm</div>
        </div>
        <div class="dish-price">22,90 €</div>
      </div>

    </div>

    <div class="foot">
      <p class="note">Zu allen Gerichten servieren wir einen frischen Beilagensalat.<br>Alle Preise in Euro inkl. gesetzlicher MwSt.</p>
      <div class="contact">
        <strong>Restaurant Am Fels</strong> · Staadter Weg 2 · 51766 Engelskirchen-Loope<br>
        Tel. 02263 9291371 · amfels.de
      </div>
    </div>

  </div>
</div>

</body>
</html>
